o-dynamics or timing, preventing a perfect score, but the overall physical realism remains solid.\n\nGround-truth scores: Visual Quality 3; Text-to-Video Alignment 4; Physical Consistency 3.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 3\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 3\n"
